OL,3,GNEWSACrash tore my hip to pieces but I
OL,4,Awill race again
OL,5,
OL,6,FA speedway rider whose hip was "torn to
OL,7,Fpieces" in a crash with a teammate says
OL,8,Fhe is determined to return to racing as
OL,9,Fsoon as he can.
OL,11,FJack Smith was competing for the
OL,12,FDerbyshire-based Buxton Bulls at home
OL,13,Fagainst the National League Nomads when
OL,14,Fhe collided with Connor Coles from his
OL,15,Fown team in April.
OL,17,F"Unfortunately, when we both tangled, I
OL,18,Fwent head over the bars, with my leg
OL,19,Ftrapped in the bike, and it's torn my
OL,20,Fhip to pieces," said Smith.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
