OL,3,GNEWSACrash tore my hip to pieces but I
OL,4,Awill race again
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was horrible, my bike's flipped
OL,7,Fover the top of me, and it could have
OL,8,Flanded anywhere, and it's hit Connor in
OL,9,Fthe head."
